{% comment %}
  ARTWISTIC: reviewer name + optional location, shared by the review
  pull-quote and the review-card rail (kept out of main-product.liquid
  to avoid duplicating the same branch in two places there).

  `layout: 'inline'` renders name + location as one span (pull-quote);
  any other value renders them as two separate spans with
  aw-review-card__name / aw-review-card__loc classes (review-card rail).

  Usage:
    {% render 'artwistic-review-attribution', name: block.settings.reviewer_name, location: block.settings.reviewer_location, layout: 'inline' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if layout == 'inline' -%}
  <span>
    {{- name -}}
    {%- if location != blank -%}
      &mdash; {{ location }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </span>
{%- else -%}
  <span class="aw-review-card__name">{{ name }}</span>
  {%- if location != blank -%}
    <span class="aw-review-card__loc">{{ location }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
